[{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"喂。阿鹏妈妈。","startTime":"2000","endTime":"3400"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"你好，我是那个动画的，邓老师就加了你微信的，然后我是看你买了个初二的动画片，妈妈就跟你了解一下同学的这个成绩，分数和丢分的一些薄弱点。因为这个是个一对一的课，了解的分数就能定制内容就问您几个问题就可以了，阿鹏，妈妈就安棒。","startTime":"3800","endTime":"24700"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"你不知道哪个是我的微信。对吧。妈妈。","startTime":"29800","endTime":"32400"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"我给你发个。你好妈妈。","startTime":"33800","endTime":"35800"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"这个","startTime":"36400","endTime":"36800"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"对，就这个上了个比情，在邓邓人就是我们妈妈的名称叫雪梅娘，对不对？妈妈好的好的。","startTime":"41800","endTime":"50400"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"可以可以可以。好，那你晚上给我打过来微信。妈妈好拜拜你先工作好。","startTime":"51600","endTime":"59328"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"这","startTime":"0","endTime":"400"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"文户","startTime":"1400","endTime":"2000"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"你在那个，你在在微信上。你你给我发个东西我不知道是哪个。","startTime":"24600","endTime":"29200"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"嗯，对的。我发给我一下。","startTime":"32200","endTime":"34000"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"这就是我。","startTime":"36600","endTime":"37400"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"嗯嗯嗯嗯。","startTime":"40600","endTime":"41800"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"晚上再跟你沟通吧。好吧。","startTime":"50000","endTime":"51600"}]